---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import GradientDivider from "../../components/GradientDivider.astro";
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Sterium Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for the Sterium grimoire, correspondences, spells, widgets, and magical planning app."
>
  <main class="home-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Sterium Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="hero-text">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </section>

    <GradientDivider />

    <section class="policy-grid">
      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium is a grimoire and magical planning application designed to
          help users explore moon timing, sabbats, planetary timing,
          correspondences, spells, and structured personal grimoire entries.
        </p>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains what information Sterium stores, how it
          is used, and how you remain in control of your magical and spiritual
          information.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Sign in with Apple</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium may use Apple's Sign in with Apple framework to securely
          identify your account across your iOS and iPadOS devices.
        </p>

        <p>
          Authentication is handled through Apple. Sterium does not receive or
          store your Apple ID password or raw Apple account credentials.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Data You Create</h2>
        <p>
          Information created within Sterium may include correspondences,
          correspondence-bank records, spells, spell details, grimoire entries,
          custom entry types, notes, spiritual references, ritual information,
          saved generated pages, and user preferences.
        </p>

        <p>
          This information is used solely to provide Sterium's grimoire,
          correspondence, spell, organization, and magical planning features.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Homepage & Widgets</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium may display magical timing and daily reference information on
          the homepage and through widgets, including moon information, the next
          sabbat countdown, planetary day and hour, today's correspondences,
          lucky hours, and suggested timing for spell work.
        </p>

        <p>
          Widget information is shared locally between the app and widget
          extensions using Apple's App Group system when required by iOS.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Correspondences</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium allows you to generate and save structured correspondence
          pages for topics such as colors, herbs, crystals, oils, moon phases,
          magical intentions, planetary associations, and other correspondence
          types you choose to create.
        </p>

        <p>
          Saved correspondence pages are added to your correspondence bank so
          they can be found, reviewed, and reused inside the app.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Spells</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium allows you to generate, create, save, and organize spells
          with structured layouts containing the details, ingredients, timing,
          instructions, correspondences, notes, and other information you choose
          to include.
        </p>

        <p>
          Spell information is stored only to provide the spell-bank,
          organization, editing, and viewing features of the app.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Grimoire Entries</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium includes a grimoire feature where you can create different
          kinds of entries and view those entries in structured layouts.
        </p>

        <p>
          Grimoire entries may include titles, categories, body text, fields,
          notes, associations, and other details you enter for your personal
          practice.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>AI Generation Features</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium may provide optional AI-powered features to help generate
          correspondence pages, spell pages, and grimoire content based on the
          prompts or instructions you provide.
        </p>

        <p>
          Information submitted to these features may be processed by approved
          AI service providers solely to return the requested generated content.
          Submitted prompts are not used by Sterium for advertising or behavior
          profiling.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Cloud Database</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium may connect securely to shared backend infrastructure and a
          cloud database so your saved correspondences, spells, grimoire
          entries, and generated pages can remain available to your account.
        </p>

        <p>
          Stored records are used to operate the app's account, grimoire,
          correspondence-bank, spell-bank, and generated-content features. They
          are not sold to advertisers or data brokers.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Magical Timing & Reference Data</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium may calculate or display moon phases, sabbat countdowns,
          planetary day and hour information, correspondences, lucky hours, and
          recommended spell timing.
        </p>

        <p>
          These features are intended for personal reference, planning, and
          spiritual use inside the app.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Analytics & Tracking</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium does not sell personal information and does not use
          third-party advertising networks or behavioral advertising systems.
        </p>

        <p>
          Your spells, correspondences, grimoire entries, notes, spiritual
          preferences, and generated content are not shared with advertisers.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>In-App Purchases</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium may offer optional premium features or subscriptions through
          Apple's StoreKit framework.
        </p>

        <p>
          Payment processing is handled entirely by Apple. Sterium does not
          collect, store, or have access to payment information, billing
          information, or credit card numbers.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Sterium is not directed toward children under the age of 13 and does
          not knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Data Deletion</h2>
        <p>
          You maintain control over your information at all times.
          Correspondences, spells, grimoire entries, generated pages, notes, and
          other content may be deleted directly within the app when supported by
          the feature.
        </p>

        <p>
          Deleting the app removes locally stored data from your device. Account
          or cloud-stored records may be deleted through Sterium's in-app
          deletion tools or by contacting support.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          This privacy policy may occasionally be updated to reflect new
          grimoire modules, widget features, generated-content tools, legal
          requirements, platform changes, or improvements to the app.
        </p>

        <p>
          Updated versions will be published on this page with a revised
          effective date.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this privacy policy or how Sterium handles
          your information, you can contact:
        </p>

        <p>
          <a href="/contact" class="contact-button">Contact</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</DocsLayout>

<style>
  .policy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .policy-card {
    background: var(--surface-standard);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .policy-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--accent-periwinkle);
  }

  .policy-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--heading-small);
  }

  .policy-card p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .policy-card a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contact-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent-periwinkle);
    color: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(242, 239, 231, 0.12);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    border-color: var(--accent-periwinkle);
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .policy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .policy-card {
      padding: 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
